[_summary]
Integration feature tests for the Shop plugin. Tests owner head lazy building to prevent Mojang session server flooding at startup.

[_does]
Tests that owner heads are lazily built to avoid flooding Mojang session servers at startup on Paper.

[_conclusions]
Lazy head building prevents session server flooding during shop startup on Paper.

